{
  "$defs": {
    "ContentBlobRef": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一份内容的取回引用 + 内容哈希（ADR-0016 §D-18.1）。\n\n把\"内容在哪里\"与\"内容是什么\"放进同一个值对象：`uri` 给出取回位置，\n`sha256` 给出该内容规范的 SHA-256（与 `ContentHash` 同一命名空间，ADR-0015 §D-21.1）。\n`media_type` 与 `byte_size` 是可选的描述性槽位。\n\n`uri` **只做非空约束**：URI 方案取决于尚未决定的存储选择（D-01、D-02），\n现在冻结方案等于把一个没做的决定写进契约。\n\n空白语义：`Contract` 基类开启了 `str_strip_whitespace`，因此 `uri` 与 `media_type`\n的纯空白取值都会先被去空白、再被 `min_length=1` 拒绝——两者**用同一条规则**，\n不存在\"空串拒绝、空白放行\"的不一致。\n\n**诚实边界**：本类型只约束**形状**。`uri` 是否可取回、取回的内容是否真的哈希成\n`sha256`、`media_type` / `byte_size` 是否与实际内容相符，都必须由持有内容的\n存储层 / Registry 核验（ADR-0016 §D-18.3）。本契约不打开 `uri`、不做任何取回，\n也**不提供**任何自报\"已验证\"的布尔标志。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "uri": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Uri",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Sha256",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "media_type": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Media Type"
        },
        "byte_size": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Byte Size"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "uri",
        "sha256"
      ],
      "title": "ContentBlobRef",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "GateResult": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "单个验证门的结构化结果（07-validation.md §2）。\n\n`threshold_source` 指向 Validation Profile 中的字段路径：阈值不得写死在流水线里。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "gate_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Gate Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "metric": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Metric",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "title": "Value",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "threshold": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Threshold"
        },
        "threshold_source": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Threshold Source"
        },
        "verdict": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Verdict"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "gate_id",
        "metric",
        "value",
        "verdict"
      ],
      "title": "GateResult",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Kind": {
      "description": "可版本化对象的类型（02-domain.md §1）。",
      "enum": [
        "dataset",
        "representation",
        "feature",
        "state",
        "event",
        "outcome",
        "strategy",
        "risk",
        "cost_model",
        "experiment",
        "hypothesis",
        "knowledge",
        "artifact",
        "profile",
        "profile_selection_rule"
      ],
      "title": "Kind",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "LlmCall": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "LLM 调用记录：LLM 只产出数据，永不裁决（09-security.md §3）。\n\nADR-0016 §D-18.2：`prompt` / `input` / `output` 三项**全部必填**，且都是\n`ContentBlobRef`（取回引用 + 内容哈希）。一次 LLM 调用总是有提示、有输入、有输出；\n允许其中任何一项缺失，等于允许记录一次无法复核的调用。原先的三个自由字符串\n`prompt_hash` / `input_hash` / `output_hash` 被它们取代——哈希仍在，位置在\n`ContentBlobRef.sha256`，并第一次带上了取回路径与格式约束。\n\n`called_at` **显式必填且没有默认值**：若默认成 `datetime.now(UTC)`，那么稍后构造 DTO\n的时刻就会冒充调用时刻，而审计记录无法分辨两者。宁可拒绝缺 `called_at` 的载荷，\n也不要一个看起来合法、实则错误的调用时间。\n\n**诚实边界（ADR-0016 §D-18.3）**：本模型完成的是**登记结构**。在存储层就位并能取回\n内容之前，`06-experiment.md` §2 的\"完整输入输出\"要求**仍未满足**：URI 可取回性、\n取回内容与 `sha256` 是否一致、登记内容是否不可覆盖、一次实验是否登记了**所有**\n发生过的调用，全部是存储层 / Registry / Runner 的未实现义务。本模型不自报验证结果。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "provider": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Provider",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "model": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Model",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "prompt": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ContentBlobRef"
        },
        "input": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ContentBlobRef"
        },
        "output": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ContentBlobRef"
        },
        "called_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Called At",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "provider",
        "model",
        "prompt",
        "input",
        "output",
        "called_at"
      ],
      "title": "LlmCall",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "OosUnsealing": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "封存样本外的开封记录（Constitution C-S2）；不可撤销。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "unsealed_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Unsealed At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "approved_by": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Approved By",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "family_unseal_count": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "title": "Family Unseal Count",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "unsealed_at",
        "approved_by",
        "family_unseal_count"
      ],
      "title": "OosUnsealing",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProfileSelection": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "实验实际使用的 Profile 选择依据（ADR-0009 §5）。\n\n必须同时给出**唯一的规则引用**、**该规则的内容哈希**与**选择输入**：\n只有规则版本不足以在事后重建\"当时按哪条规则、按什么输入选中了哪个 Profile\"。\n取消空默认值——缺绑定的实验不得进入 Validation。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "selection_rule": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
        },
        "selection_rule_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Selection Rule Hash",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "key": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProfileSelectionKey"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "selection_rule",
        "selection_rule_hash",
        "key"
      ],
      "title": "ProfileSelection",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProfileSelectionKey": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "选择输入：标的、周期、预登记的研究类别。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "venue": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Venue",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Symbol",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "timeframe": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Timeframe",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "research_class": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Research Class",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "venue",
        "symbol",
        "timeframe",
        "research_class"
      ],
      "title": "ProfileSelectionKey",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Ref": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对象引用：`{kind}:{name}@{version}`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Kind"
        },
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "name",
        "version"
      ],
      "title": "Ref",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Verdict": {
      "enum": [
        "PASS",
        "FAIL",
        "INCONCLUSIVE"
      ],
      "title": "Verdict",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "每个实验实际使用的规则版本与配置（06-experiment.md §3）。\n\n追加式、不可修改；与 ValidationReport 一起构成审计证据。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.1.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "experiment_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Experiment Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "constitution_version": {
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Constitution Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "validation_profile": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
    },
    "validation_profile_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Validation Profile Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "profile_selection": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ProfileSelection"
    },
    "hypothesis_family_id": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Hypothesis Family Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "trial_index": {
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
      "title": "Trial Index",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "family_trial_count": {
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
      "title": "Family Trial Count",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "declared_research_class": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Declared Research Class",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "realized_holding_stats": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "title": "Realized Holding Stats",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "gate_results": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/GateResult"
      },
      "title": "Gate Results",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "oos_unsealing": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/OosUnsealing"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "llm_calls": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/LlmCall"
      },
      "title": "Llm Calls",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "trace_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Trace Id"
    },
    "recorded_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Recorded At",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "experiment_hash",
    "constitution_version",
    "validation_profile",
    "validation_profile_hash",
    "profile_selection",
    "hypothesis_family_id",
    "trial_index",
    "family_trial_count",
    "declared_research_class"
  ],
  "title": "ExperimentMetadata",
  "type": "object"
}
